  ],
  "difficulty": 2,
  "marks": 1,
  "estimatedSeconds": 90,
  "stem": "$X \\sim \\mathrm{N}(\\mu, \\sigma^2)$. Approximately what proportion of values lie between $\\mu - 2\\sigma$ and $\\mu + 2\\sigma$?",
