  "workedSolution": "1. One bag: $\\mathrm{P}(X < 490) = \\mathrm{P}(Z < -1.25) = 1 - 0.8944 = 0.1056$. At least one of six: $1 - (1 - 0.1056)^6 = 1 - 0.8944^6 = 0.488$.",
